<title>JAPAN: Janome -6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Janome -6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		 27.28		vs	   30.83</p>
<p> Operating   loss 421    million    vs	prft 507 million</p>
<p> Current     loss 258    million    vs	prft 236 million</p>
<p> Net	   loss 314    million    vs   loss 132    million</p>
<p> EPS	     loss 2.06 yen	  vs     loss 0.87 yen</p>
<p> Shares	    152 million	  vs	 152 million</p>
<p> Interim div	   nil		vs	     nil</p>
<p>NOTE - Janome Sewing Machine Co Ltd is a household sewing machine manufacturer.</p>
</text>
